  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "\"You know Walter, sometimes it doesn't hurt to have someone watching your back\"\n\nThe Hitmen twins of the Juarez Cartel, Leonel and Marco Salamanca, often known as the \"Cousins\", have set off from Mexico in search of Walter White. They come across an informant, who only agrees to help them if they solve his puzzle of interesting numbers.\n\nThere are NNN interesting numbers AAA111,,, AAA222,,, ......... AAANNN consisting of integers from 111 to NNN.\n\nThe task is to find KKKththth smallest GCDGCDGCD among all GCDGCDGCD ((( AAAiii,AAAjjj))) for each (i,j)(i,j)(i,j), such that 1≤i&lt;j≤N1 \\leq i &lt; j \\leq N1≤i&lt;j≤N.\n\nPrint the KKKththth smallest GCDGCDGCD and also find any pair having the resultant GCDGCDGCD (print their indices).\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line will contain TTT, number of testcases. TTT testcases follow :\nThe first line of each testcase contains two space-separated integers N,KN, KN,K.\nThe second line of each testcase contains NNN space-separated integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, print two lines.\n\n\n\nOn the first line, print the KKKththth smallest GCDGCDGCD.\nOn the second line, print any pair of indices (x,y)(x,y)(x,y) such that xxx != yyy and GCDGCDGCD ((( AAAxxx,AAAyyy))) = KKKththth smallest GCDGCDGCD.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1041 \\leq T \\leq 10^41≤T≤104",
      "2≤N≤1062 \\leq N \\leq 10^62≤N≤106",
      "1≤K≤(N∗(N−1))/21 \\leq K \\leq (N*(N-1))/21≤K≤(N∗(N−1))/2",
      "1≤A1 \\leq A1≤Aiii ≤N  \\leq  N≤N",
      "The sum of NNN over all test cases does not exceed 10610^6106"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "2\n5 8\n2 4 4 1 3\n5 7\n2 4 4 1 3",
        "output": "2\n1 2\n1\n4 5",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nFor Test Case 1 :  KKKththth smallest GCDGCDGCD is 222, and GCDGCDGCD ((( AAA111 , AAA222))) = 222.\n\n\nFor Test Case 2 : KKKththth smallest GCDGCDGCD is 111, and GCDGCDGCD ((( AAA444 , AAA555))) = 111."
      }
